  2 M-USERARC-SYMBOLS (A95/1:#MAX-SYMBOLS)
  2 REDEFINE M-USERARC-SYMBOLS
    3 M-USERARC-SYMBOL-NAME-VALUE (1:#MAX-SYMBOLS)
      4 M-USERARC-SYMBOL-NAME (A10)
      4 M-USERARC-SYMBOL-VALUE (A85)
* **End of LDA VUSARC-L *************************************************
